\" lang=\"EN-US\">30</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 45pt; HEIGHT: 16pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\" valign=\"center\" rowspan=\"2\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">제 4차</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 29pt; HEIGHT: 15pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">28</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 26pt; HEIGHT: 15pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 29pt; HEIGHT: 15pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">30</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><p></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN-TOP: 14pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">나. 선발 방법 </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">1) 연수대상인원 112명 중 50%(56명)는 개인지원자 대상 우리 원이 선발하고,</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">50%(56명)는 격년 추천 배정지역의 대학 추천을 받아 우리 원이 최종 선발</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">2) 기초생활수급자 및 차상위계층은 각 선발방법 배정인원의 5%내 우선 선발</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN-TOP: 14pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">다. 대학 추천에 의한 선발방법 - 대학별 추천 대상 </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\" class=\"바탕글\"></p><p></p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 38pt; HEIGHT: 20pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">구 분</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 448pt; HEIGHT: 20pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">추천 배정지역</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 38pt; HEIGHT: 37pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">1~3단</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 448pt; HEIGHT: 37pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\" valign=\"center\"><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">- 강원, 대전, 경북, 경남, 광주, 전남, 전북, 부산, 울산, 대구, 제주 소재 4년제 대학 추천자 및 한일학술문화 및 청소년교류 방한단 연수 위탁운영대학(4개) 추천자 </span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 38pt; HEIGHT: 21pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">4단</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 448pt; HEIGHT: 21pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\" valign=\"center\"><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">- 강원, 대전, 세종, 서울, 인천, 경기, 충남, 충북 소재 전문대학</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 38pt; HEIGHT: 59pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">공통</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 448pt; HEIGHT: 59pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\" valign=\"center\"><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">- 추천자격 (붙임1 참조)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">? 4년제 : 당해 연도 1학년~3학년 1학기 재학 중인 자</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">? 전문대 : 1학년~최종학년 1학기 재학 중인 자 </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">- 추천인원:</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"> 대학별 1명 추천(연수시기 및 배정여부 확인)</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 38pt; HEIGHT: 19pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">단장</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 448pt; HEIGHT: 19pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">- 방한연수단 위탁대학(대전대, 경희대 추천), 희망단 우선 배정하나 변경 가능</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><p></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN-TOP: 14pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">라. 연수경비 지원 안내</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\" class=\"바탕글\"></p><p></p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 117pt; HEIGHT: 20pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">구 분</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 366pt; HEIGHT: 20pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">부담내역</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 117pt; HEIGHT: 23pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">국립국제교육원</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 366pt; HEIGHT: 23pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">왕복 항공료, 해외여행보험 (※ 체재비는 일본 부담)</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 117pt; HEIGHT: 23pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">개인 부담</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 366pt; HEIGHT: 23pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">사전교육일 및 출입국시 국내이동경비, 일비, 여권발급비 등</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><p></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">마. 행정 사항</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 70pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\">ｏ 추천 기한 : 2013. 5. 23.(금) </span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 70pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\">ｏ 제출 방법 : 개인지원자 교육원담당자에게 E-mail로 제출</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 70pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">대학추천 - 전자문서로 제출(증빙서류 별도 우편 송부)</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 70pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">ｏ 제출 서류 : 붙임 참조</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 70pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">ｏ 적격자가 없을 시에는 \"해당자 없음\"으로 공문발송 요망</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 70pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">ｏ 기한 내 미도착할 경우, 적격자 없음으로 간주</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\">붙임 1. 2014년도 한?일 학술문화 및 청소년교류 대학생단 선발 계획 1부</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">2. 2014년 방일 대학생단 추천대학 배정표 1부</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
